{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/4cf664cd24439c1a49f73269e87cf4a6.avif?t=1753188521\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/2960492eb7c856a4350c368b4d4fba40.poster.avif?t=1753188521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/2960492eb7c856a4350c368b4d4fba40.webm?t=1753188521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/2960492eb7c856a4350c368b4d4fba40.mp4?t=1753188521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take care of your desktop garden while you work, study, or relax! <br><strong>My Tiny Garden</strong> is a cozy game that runs at the bottom of your screen, turning your desktop into a comfortable little world of plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your screen, customize your garden, and build the calmest corner of your digital life. <br><strong>My Tiny Garden</strong> is the perfect relaxing companion for your daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/bb838e35e441b45d96bf2e95e0ec2926.avif?t=1753188521\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.poster.avif?t=1753188521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.webm?t=1753188521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/08fa474c96b7014947b73ae73365c9b9.mp4?t=1753188521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Take care of your plants</strong>: Water, trim, and add compost to keep them happy and healthy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Earn coins</strong>: Well-cared-for plants will reward you with coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3c <strong>Unlock new content</strong>: Use coins to buy new types of plants, pots, and stands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf80 <strong>Customize your garden</strong>: Add cute decorations to make your garden unique and cozy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>Decorate your desktop</strong>: Freely move your plants around and create a charming environment while you use your computer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Calm and relaxing atmosphere</strong>: Perfect for keeping things peaceful while you work or study.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/15f0bda4589db9c694c7237863919393.poster.avif?t=1753188521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/15f0bda4589db9c694c7237863919393.webm?t=1753188521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/15f0bda4589db9c694c7237863919393.mp4?t=1753188521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>This demo has some limitations. Only a few pots, plants, and decorations are available, and not all game features are included.</u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3804720?t=1753188521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/b3f8d4ead7bd363be9552c2c578ea3719ec8cfab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753188521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/2b4c746f08ac707d8bb5c7a4b43fdc47f7f6736a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753188521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/2b4c746f08ac707d8bb5c7a4b43fdc47f7f6736a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753188521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/4cf664cd24439c1a49f73269e87cf4a6.avif?t=1753188521\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/2960492eb7c856a4350c368b4d4fba40.poster.avif?t=1753188521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/2960492eb7c856a4350c368b4d4fba40.webm?t=1753188521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804720/extras/2960492eb7c856a4350c368b4d4fba40.mp4?t=1753188521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take care of your desktop garden while you work, study, or relax! <br><strong>My Tiny Garden</strong> is a cozy game that runs at the b